33309247422837719_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XNKXNO6jl5wQ7kNvwF8ULfq&_nc_oc=AdoWMfIRK3yYxiav11bWdqn0AiIakm-JiCf-I1lXogNY3jRgVpG8_GgHKlmk5Ifun5k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTVGS_jbnPrft3MMSeX6yhUz5vf_psEIgOy8SBCL8yBOw&oe=6AF0AAB8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "PV Associate", "keywords": ["PV", "Training", "Immerselearn"], "long_description": "PV Associate is part of the Immerse Learn PV Associate Certification Program and is accessible only to students enrolled in the program. This VR simulation provides a comprehensive, hands-on learning experience in photovoltaic (PV) technology. Training modules include system design, installation, and maintenance; PV components and their roles in operation; safety considerations and regulatory compliance; solar resource assessment; system sizing and optimization; structural and electrical requirements; energy storage integration and hybrid systems; commissioning and troubleshooting; and long-term maintenance. Learners will also explore financial aspects such as incentives and utility bill analysis. Developed to align with industry standards, PV Associate offers a safe, immersive environment where students can build technical expertise, improve safety awareness, and gain practical skills for real-world solar energy careers. Access is restricted to enrolled students only.", "short_description": "PV Associate is a VR training app developed as part of the Immerse Learn PV Associate Certification Program. Available exclusively to enrolled students, it offers hands-on training in photovoltaic (PV) systems, covering system components, design, installation, safety, performance optimization, and maintenance in a realistic virtual environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Immerse Learn", "support_websi